flowchart LR
    Admin[Admin] -->|PDF bytes| Validate[Validation and SHA-256]
    Validate -->|UUID PDF| Disk[(Configured upload directory)]
    Disk -->|page text| Split[Chunking]
    Split -->|text| Google[Google embedding API]
    Google -->|vectors| Index[(FAISS)]
    Split -->|source metadata| Mapping[(JSON mapping)]
    User[Authenticated user] -->|question| Search[Retrieval]
    Index --> Search
    Mapping --> Search
    Search -->|bounded evidence| LLM[Gemini API]
    LLM -->|claims and quotes| Verify[Evidence validation]
    Verify -->|answer and source rows| Audit[(MySQL audit)]
    Verify --> User
